<<<
arch-, arche-, archi-. Though the prefix arch- (chief &c.) is pronounced arch in all words except archangel & its derivatives, the longer forms are relied ny ee arkI: so arch-
===
**arch-, arche-, archi-.** Though the prefix *arch-* (chief &c.) is pronounced arch in all words except *archangel* & its derivatives, the longer forms are always pronounced *arki* : so *archbishop*
>>>

